 "reading": {
  "blocks": [
   {"kind":"heading","text":"# Tide clock, brass","characters":19,"links":0,"linked":0,"level":1,"onScreen":true,"start":"Tide clock, brass","plain":17},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"129 EUR, in stock","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"onScreen":true},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"A tide clock has one hand, which goes round once in twelve hours and twenty-five minutes, the time from one high water to the next. Set it at high water on a day of full moon and it will show the hours to the next high and the next low for weeks, on any coast where the tide comes twice a day.","characters":293,"links":0,"linked":0},
   {"kind":"heading","text":"## Specifications","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"level":2,"start":"Specifications","plain":14},
   {"kind":"table","text":"| Case | Brass, lacquered |\n| --- | --- |\n| Across | 18 cm |\n| Movement | Quartz, one AA cell |\n| Made in | Dover |","characters":115,"links":0,"linked":0},
   {"kind":"heading","text":"## Customer reviews","characters":19,"links":0,"linked":0,"level":2,"start":"Customer reviews","plain":16},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Mara**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Mara, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"It has hung by the door of the boathouse for a year and I have not opened the printed tables since. Set it on a spring tide as the leaflet says, not on any day you like, or it will run a quarter of an hour out by the next neaps and you will blame the clock.","characters":257,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Jonah**, 4 stars","characters":18,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Jonah, 4 stars","plain":14},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Handsome, and right to within ten minutes here. The lacquer marks if you touch it with wet hands.","characters":97,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**K. Pilot**, 5 stars","characters":21,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"K. Pilot, 5 stars","plain":17},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Bought for my father, who has sailed out of this harbour for fifty years and trusts nothing. He trusts this.","characters":108,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Ines**, 3 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Ines, 3 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Works, but our tide is one a day for part of the month and then the hand means nothing. The shop said so, to be fair.","characters":117,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Tom**, 5 stars","characters":16,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Tom, 5 stars","plain":12},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Came in two days, well packed, with a cell already in it.","characters":57,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Ruth**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Ruth, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"The face is easy to read from across the room, which the cheaper ones are not.","characters":78,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Olu**, 4 stars","characters":16,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Olu, 4 stars","plain":12},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Good. I would pay more for one that showed springs and neaps as well.","characters":69,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Hana**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Hana, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"A present for a friend who has just moved to the coast. She says the whole street comes to look at it.","characters":102,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Piet**, 4 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Piet, 4 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Runs a little fast. I put it back by five minutes at each full moon and that is that.","characters":85,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Seo-yeon**, 5 stars","characters":21,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Seo-yeon, 5 stars","plain":17},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"The brass is thicker than it looks in the pictures, and the hook on the back is a proper one.","characters":93,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Gwen**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Gwen, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Second one I have bought. The first is still going after nine years on a damp wall.","characters":83,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Arlo**, 2 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Arlo, 2 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Mine came with a scratch across the glass. The shop sent another, but it took three weeks.","characters":90,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Bea**, 5 stars","characters":16,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Bea, 5 stars","plain":12},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"I teach sailing to children, and it is the first thing they look at when they come in. A clock that tells them when they can launch, they say, and they are nearly right: it tells them when the slip is covered, which at our club is two hours either side of high water and not a minute more.","characters":289,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Yusuf**, 4 stars","characters":18,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Yusuf, 4 stars","plain":14},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Does what it says. The leaflet is in six languages and good in none of them.","characters":76,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Nell**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Nell, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Lovely thing. It ticks, which I had not expected and have come to like.","characters":71,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Dev**, 4 stars","characters":16,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Dev, 4 stars","plain":12},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Accurate enough for walking the dog on the sands, which is all I ask of it.","characters":75,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Ilse**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Ilse, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Bought after reading the reviews here, and they were right about setting it at springs.","characters":87,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Sam**, 3 stars","characters":16,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Sam, 3 stars","plain":12},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Fine, but dear for a quartz movement in a brass case.","characters":53,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Joan**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Joan, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"My husband checks it against the tables every morning and has yet to catch it out by more than a few minutes.","characters":109,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Levi**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Levi, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Exactly as described, and the shop answered my question about the hook within the hour.","characters":87,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Aiko**, 4 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Aiko, 4 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"The hand is a little hard to see against the face in low light. Otherwise very good.","characters":84,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Finn**, 5 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Finn, 5 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Hung it in the galley of the boat. It has been through two winters afloat and looks new.","characters":88,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Odile**, 5 stars","characters":18,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Odile, 5 stars","plain":14},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"A friend had one and I wanted the same. No regrets, and it came sooner than promised.","characters":85,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"**Ravi**, 4 stars","characters":17,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review","start":"Ravi, 4 stars","plain":13},
   {"kind":"paragraph","text":"Needs a new cell about once a year. It slows for a week before it stops, which is a fair warning.","characters":97,"links":0,"linked":0,"hint":"review"},
